# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `lib/` is a Python build-output
# pattern that also matches `frontend/src/lib/`, which is TypeScript source --
# it silently kept `paneLayout.ts` out of the tree the panes work depends on,
# and a fresh clone would have failed to build. The only `lib` directory in the
# repository is that one.
